Discovery — dimensions available on IIS metrics
fetch metric.series
| filter metric.key == "dt.runtime.iis.requests"
| fields metric.key, dimensions
| limit 5


Also worth checking directly with a timeseries call to see what by: grouping is possible:

timeseries requests = sum(dt.runtime.iis.requests), by:{dt.entity.host}
| fieldsAdd hostname = entityName(dt.entity.host)
| fields hostname, requests
| limit 10


